invariant: INV-7
file: quic_version.h
catches: quic_test
reason: version 2 advances its 1-RTT secrets under version 1's key update
  label "quic ku", where RFC 9369 section 3.3.2 names "quicv2 ku"
  (rfc9369.txt:167-174), so after the first key update a version 2
  session holds keys its peer does not. test/quic_version2_tests.h
  requires RFC 9369 Appendix A.5's key update secret.

--- old
        {"quicv2 key", "quicv2 iv", "quicv2 hp", "quicv2 ku"},
--- new
        {"quicv2 key", "quicv2 iv", "quicv2 hp", "quic ku"},
